    {
      "id": "6",
      "t": "送崔九 裴迪  歸山深淺去，須盡丘壑美。",
      "c": "送崔九 裴迪  归山深浅去，须尽丘壑美。",
      "p": "sòng cuī jiǔ  péi dí  guī shān shēn qiǎn qù ， xū jìn qiū hè měi 。",
      "z": "ㄙㄨㄥˋ ㄘㄨㄟ ㄐㄧㄡˇ  ㄆㄟˊ ㄉㄧˊ  ㄍㄨㄟ ㄕㄢ ㄕㄣ ㄑㄧㄢˇ ㄑㄩˋ ， ㄒㄩ ㄐㄧㄣˋ ㄑㄧㄡ ㄏㄜˋ ㄇㄟˇ 。",
      "en": "Farewell to Cui Jiu by Pei Di (Excerpt: Returning to the mountains...)",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
        "data": "github/json",
        "dataLocation": "https://github.com/feelryan/jujuen/blob/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07-sec6.json",
        "renderObject": "Words",
        "bgImageSrc": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/feelryan/jujuen/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07/chapter07-sec6.png"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "t": "終南望餘雪 祖詠  終南陰嶺秀，積雪浮雲端。",
      "c": "终南望余雪 祖咏  终南阴岭秀，积雪浮云端。",
      "p": "zhōng nán wàng yú xuě  zǔ yǒng  zhōng nán yīn lǐng xiù ， jī xuě fú yún duān 。",
      "z": "ㄓㄨㄥ ㄋㄢˊ ㄨㄤˋ ㄩˊ ㄒㄩㄝˇ  ㄗㄨˇ ㄩㄥˇ  ㄓㄨㄥ ㄋㄢˊ ㄧㄣ ㄌㄧㄥˇ ㄒㄧㄡˋ ， ㄐㄧ ㄒㄩㄝˇ ㄈㄨˊ ㄩㄣˊ ㄉㄨㄢ 。",
      "en": "Viewing the Remaining Snow on Mount Zhongnan by Zu Yong (Excerpt: The northern ridge of Zhongnan...)",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
        "data": "github/json",
        "dataLocation": "https://github.com/feelryan/jujuen/blob/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07-sec7.json",
        "renderObject": "Words",
        "bgImageSrc": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/feelryan/jujuen/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07/chapter07-sec7.png"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "t": "宿建德江 孟浩然  移舟泊煙渚，日暮客愁新。",
      "c": "宿建德江 孟浩然  移舟泊烟渚，日暮客愁新。",
      "p": "sù jiàn dé jiāng  mèng hào rán  yí zhōu bó yān zhǔ ， rì mù kè chóu xīn 。",
      "z": "ㄙㄨˋ ㄐㄧㄢˋ ㄉㄜˊ ㄐㄧㄤ  ㄇㄥˋ ㄏㄠˋ ㄖㄢˊ  ㄧˊ ㄓㄡ ㄅㄛˊ ㄧㄢ ㄓㄨˇ ， ㄖˋ ㄇㄨˋ ㄎㄜˋ ㄔㄡˊ ㄒㄧㄣ 。",
      "en": "Mooring on the Jiande River by Meng Haoran (Excerpt: Moving the boat to moor by the misty islet...)",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
        "data": "github/json",
        "dataLocation": "https://github.com/feelryan/jujuen/blob/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07-sec8.json",
        "renderObject": "Words",
