      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "t": "春曉 孟浩然  春眠不覺曉，處處聞啼鳥。",
      "c": "春晓 孟浩然  春眠不觉晓，处处闻啼鸟。",
      "p": "chūn xiǎo  mèng hào rán  chūn mián bù jué xiǎo ， chù chù wén tí niǎo 。",
      "z": "ㄔㄨㄣ ㄒㄧㄠˇ  ㄇㄥˋ ㄏㄠˋ ㄖㄢˊ  ㄔㄨㄣ ㄇㄧㄢˊ ㄅㄨˋ ㄐㄩㄝˊ ㄒㄧㄠˇ ， ㄔㄨˋ ㄔㄨˋ ㄨㄣˊ ㄊㄧˊ ㄋㄧㄠˇ 。",
      "en": "Spring Dawn by Meng Haoran (Excerpt: Sleeping in spring, unaware of the dawn...)",
      "pointTo": {
        "type": "document",
        "data": "github/json",
        "dataLocation": "https://github.com/feelryan/jujuen/blob/ancient-classics/Three Hundred Tang Poems/chapter07-sec9.json",
